// M5-A3P-1014. Ending R4 "Rest: the empty place" (E, 0.75 min). act3_ending.md §2 R4. No dialogue.
// Rhen sits where Kerrid stood. Toma sits beside him, NOT TOUCHING. The deck is empty of the dead. Only a few motes still
// rise off the sea, far below and much nearer than before. The bed thins to nothing.
title: ending_rest_empty_place
location: ch18/kite
---
@music silence fade=20.0
@mark rhen kite_rail walk
@anim rhen sit kite_rail
@mark toma kite_rail_b walk
@anim toma sit kite_rail_b
@vfx glimmer_lift at=sea_far count=8 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 40.0
===
